$NetBSD: patch-libelf_Makefile,v 1.1 2011/11/26 15:50:27 dholland Exp $

Retain the minor version required by bootstrap-mk-files.
Use ABI 2 for the BSD Elf_Data layout. Its uint64_t alignment and size fields
change the 32-bit layout from the 0.7.1 release. The base uses ABI 2 as well.
The EmberBSD recipe guard prevents a second package provider there.

--- libelf/Makefile~	2011-01-01 11:17:52.000000000 +0000
+++ libelf/Makefile
@@ -61,6 +61,7 @@ GENSRCS=	libelf_fsize.c libelf_msize.c l
 CLEANFILES=	${GENSRCS}
 
-SHLIB_MAJOR=	1
+SHLIB_MAJOR=	2
+SHLIB_MINOR=	0
 
 WARNS?=	6
 
